<Entity class="oracle.dbtools.crest.model.design.logical.Entity" directorySegmentName="seg_1" id="3862A235-456A-1239-9279-A7922ED769CB" name="Cash on hand national general accepted accounting principles (nGAAP)">
<createdBy>nuvolia</createdBy>
<createdTime>2026-03-27 09:38:36 UTC</createdTime>
<commentInRDBMS><![CDATA[Cash on hand national general accepted accounting principles (nGAAP)  shall include holdings of national and foreign banknotes and coins in circulation that are commonly used to make payments.

According to ESA 2010 this includes "Monetary gold", which is indicated via the currency "XAU". See ESA 2010 paragraph 5.65 - 5.68.]]></commentInRDBMS>
